  dct:description "Installation and operation of charging stations for electric cars at various locations in Reykjavik.  Charging stations have to be installed on foundations that have been installed at car parks and on street parking, connected to the grid and operated for 5-8 years.  Total number of parking spaces is 94 at 20 locations in Reykjavik.  Bids can be on one or more locations"@en;
  dct:title "16041 Installation and operation of charging stations for electric cars in Reykjavik."@en;
